(Automated Code Synthesis & AI Reimplementation Covenant)
================================================================================

1. Purpose and Intent:
   This Commercial License & AI/Automated-Translation Provenance Notice
   establishes binding restrictions on commercial deployment and on the
   automated, machine-assisted, or artificial-intelligence-driven harvesting,
   decompilation, translation, synthesis, or reimplementation of this
   software's proprietary algorithms, zero-allocation data structures,
   queue-reactive models, and matching engine architectures for commercial
   exploitation.

2. Commercial License Requirement & Automated Derivative Translation Restriction:
   A separate commercial license from the copyright holder is strictly required
   for any commercial / proprietary trading deployment or automated derivative
   translation. You may NOT input, prompt, fine-tune, ingest, embed, or process
   this source code, its architecture specifications, algorithmic structures,
   or benchmarks into any generative artificial intelligence system, large
   language model (LLM), neural code translation engine, or automated code
   synthesis tool for the purpose of generating, deriving, translating, or
   outputting a commercial derivative work, clean-room commercial
   reimplementation, or functional clone in any programming language (including
   C++, Rust, C, Java, Go, Zig, Python, or Lean) without an explicit, executed
   commercial license from the copyright holder.

3. Contractual Enforceability and Derivative Work Definition:
   Under applicable contract law, the copyright regimes of Berne Convention
   signatory nations, and trade secret frameworks:
   (a) Any functional reproduction or automated derivative translation produced
       by an AI, LLM, or automated synthesis pipeline that reproduces the
       algorithmic structures, sequence-form microstructure dynamics,
       zero-tombstone intrusive slotmap unlinking, bitwise van Emde Boas /
       Elias-Fano structures, or state-dependent queue-reactive intensity
       formulas of this software shall be deemed a derivative work governed by
       this license.
   (b) Using this software to prompt or instruct an AI model to produce
       unlicensed commercial software constitutes a direct breach of this
       license agreement and intentional interference with intellectual
       property rights.

4. Academic and Non-Production Evaluation Exemption:
   Academic analysis, non-commercial peer-reviewed research, educational study,
